      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PICTURES TO SHOW PEOPLE        src/mockups\n\nImages of an idea \u2014 for a deck, a story, a meeting.\nNot something anyone can click.\n\nBuilt out of the real pieces, so a picture can't\npromise something that doesn't exist.",
      "originalText": "PICTURES TO SHOW PEOPLE        src/mockups\n\nImages of an idea \u2014 for a deck, a story, a meeting.\nNot something anyone can click.\n\nBuilt out of the real pieces, so a picture can't\npromise something that doesn't exist.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-148314169",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
